From 90553ab6ede957c75876a3fd1cad633b54bfeb86 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Close contained tasks by terminal archive after
 authority ends

Archive is a non-success cancellation, not a release: preserve the containment marker and immutable closure receipts, reject resurrection, and keep dependents gated locally and on synced replicas. Canonical archive requires the Board terminal_archive capability and authenticated exact-event readback.

Proof: fresh-main RED reproduces containment_pending at archive after authority archive; candidate GREEN 47 new tests and 142 compatibility tests. Full scripts/check passes. Board transport and full consumer validation follow before ship.
